<BaseLayout title="Getting started — Ferrite docs" description="An introduction to Ferrite and its active-development release state.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Docs / Getting started</div><h1>Start with the shape of the product.</h1><p>Ferrite is a native Windows launcher for Java Edition modded Minecraft. The public build is still being prepared.</p></div></section>
  <div class="container prose"><h2>What Ferrite is for</h2><p>Ferrite brings instances, content discovery, Java runtimes, loaders and repair tooling into one desktop workflow. It is designed for players who want a short path to play and a clear path when something needs attention.</p><h2>Before a public release</h2><p>Follow the source repository and changelog for progress. Do not treat internal packages or development artifacts as public downloads.</p></div>
